    "body": "Oh, you're right, thanks for the link. \r\n\r\nI think `Sec-Fetch-Dest` works! The definition of the [`document`](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-destination) value is: \"HTML’s navigate algorithm (top-level only),\" which is what we want. This also makes it possible for forms to add new targets in the future without impacting servers who only want CORS for top-level navigation today.\r\n\r\nIt should also apply to PNLA links.",
