    "updated_at": "2024-12-12T02:31:52Z",
    "body": "Yep. This would allow CORS for any fetch with the `navigate` mode. We're just saying that servers will have the opportunity to disallow CORS-enabled navigations with even more granularity (top-level, iFrame, and so on), based on the `Sec-Fetch-Dest` header, if they so choose.",
